Table full name: TCGA.TCGA_VERSIONED.PER_SAMPLE_FILE_METADATA_HG19_GDC_R25
Column name: sample_barcode Type: TEXT Description: Submitter sample barcode, eg TCGA-12-1089-01A
Column name: file_name_key Type: TEXT Description: GDC path to original BAM or VCF file
Column name: program_name Type: TEXT Description: Program name, eg TCGA or TARGET
Column name: data_category Type: TEXT Description: Category description of the underlying data, eg Clinical, Raw Sequencing Data, Simple Nucleotide Variation, Transcriptome Profiling, etc
Column name: data_type Type: TEXT Description: Experimental source of the data type, eg Tissue slide image, RNA-Seq
Column name: experimental_strategy Type: TEXT Description: Experimental strategy used to generate data (where applicable) e.g. WXS, RNA-Seq
Column name: project_short_name Type: TEXT Description: Project name abbreviation; the program name appended with a project name abbreviation; eg. TCGA-OV, etc.
