Table full name: TCGA.TCGA_VERSIONED.CLINICAL_DIAGNOSES_TREATMENTS_GDC_R29
Column name: diag__treat__treatment_type Type: TEXT Description: Text term that describes the kind of treatment administered.
Column name: diag__treat__treatment_or_therapy Type: TEXT Description: A yes/no/unknown/not applicable indicator related to the administration of therapeutic agents received.
Column name: case_id Type: TEXT Description: GDC unique identifier for this case (corresponds to the case_barcode) -- this can be used to access more information from the GDC data portal in the following way: https://portal.gdc.cancer.gov/files/c21b332c-06c6-4403-9032-f91c8f407ba9.
Column name: diag__diagnosis_id Type: TEXT Description: GDC-assigned identifier for a case's diagnosis.
Sample rows:
[{'diag__diagnosis_id': 'f1207955-f463-570c-b29c-7577ec63f8c2', 'case_id': '6ee6ca0a-8702-480d-b2d1-9224e7dd9211', 'diag__treat__treatment_type': 'Radiation Therapy, NOS', 'diag__treat__treatment_or_therapy': 'no'}, {'diag__diagnosis_id': 'dbb15873-9487-57d6-a65b-7c8e10a50b2f', 'case_id': '2a2f2663-d813-41ff-a4e2-dfe0f16d236d', 'diag__treat__treatment_type': 'Radiation Therapy, NOS', 'diag__treat__treatment_or_therapy': 'no'}, {'diag__diagnosis_id': 'fd19e47b-cbaa-5a26-aef7-0ba6758500b0', 'case_id': '0e084325-ba97-4c0a-9d00-12d01b4bc0bb', 'diag__treat__treatment_type': 'Radiation Therapy, NOS', 'diag__treat__treatment_or_therapy': 'no'}, {'diag__diagnosis_id': '9a229056-7b85-508c-8bc5-064651d7cc60', 'case_id': '6020ec67-8f3b-409f-a0ed-2af849b4d76f', 'diag__treat__treatment_type': 'Radiation Therapy, NOS', 'diag__treat__treatment_or_therapy': 'no'}, {'diag__diagnosis_id': 'a9117477-ee48-564f-b57d-141e83666a38', 'case_id': '962fd4e7-9199-43d9-abce-e3dfa46da62c', 'diag__treat__treatment_type': 'Radiation Therapy, NOS', 'diag__treat__treatment_or_therapy': 'no'}]

