Some few-shot examples may be useful:
Query:
--Description: 1) Look at somatic‐mutation entries for CDKN2A in the TCGA-BLCA cohort (hg19 MC3 set)
SELECT DISTINCT 
       "project_short_name",
       "case_barcode",
       "Hugo_Symbol",
       "Variant_Classification",
       "Variant_Type"
FROM   TCGA.TCGA_VERSIONED."SOMATIC_MUTATION_HG19_MC3_2017_02"
WHERE  "project_short_name" = 'TCGA-BLCA'
  AND  "Hugo_Symbol" ILIKE '%CDKN2A%'
LIMIT 20;
Answer:
project_short_name,case_barcode,Hugo_Symbol,Variant_Classification,Variant_Type
